   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "This, that and that one over there",
     "texto": [
      "Korean has three distances. **이** (this): near me. **그** (that): near you. **저** (that, over there): far from both of us.",
      "Before a noun: **이 책** (this book), **그 책** (that book), **저 책** (that book over there).",
      "On their own, when speaking: **이거** (this), **그거** (that), **저거** (that one over there).",
      "When they are the subject of the sentence they are shortened: **이게**, **그게**, **저게**. That is why «what is this?» is **이게 뭐예요?**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Three distances",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
