     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Whose it is",
     "texto": [
      "To say «of» there is the particle **의** (pronounced «eh»), but in speech it is almost always left out: **민수 씨 책** = Minsu's book.",
      "**누구** = who. **누구 거예요?** = Whose is it? (거 = «thing», «the one of»).",
      "**제 거예요** = it's mine. **민수 씨 거예요** = it's Minsu's."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
